Sinble Unsub
- Check contact is subscribed in SFMC and CRM
- 'Communication' page -> Unsub with any reason (Except Temp Pause)
- Check contact is unsubscribed in SFMC
- Add/Update contact in 'QA_Master_Guest_Subscription_Salesforce' for resubscription process
- Run the Automation 'QA_ResubscribeAutomation_OasisBay'
- See the contact is subscribed in SFMC
- To subscribe the contact in CRM, one has to manually the receive updates.

Single 'Temp Pause'
- Check contact is subscribed in SFMC and CRM
- 'Communication' page -> Unsub with 'Temp Pause'
- Update the date within the range of 30 to 32 days previous than today's date in 'TempPauseHandle_QA'
- Run the Automation 'TemporarySuppression_30Days_OasisBay_QA'
- See the contact is subscribed in SFMC & in CRM as well (If subscribed in CRM, 'Prev' CTA displayed on Thankyou page)

